{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1320.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"73c38bd6722d10c446c9e25776e912c20aa96c9555088c4385feeaf5db9f1fe1","ja":"夢は大きく！","zh":"梦想就要远大！","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1320.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"8d3128f53075bf66fc3b9d1ef32bad7cfbb667bfcea93faf76c53adb28a4d8d4","ja":"「始まりました、クイズ『ダブルアップ』！」","zh":"“问答节目《Double Up》现在开始！”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1320.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"635558c2378b9cbe1907340a2c6393c2d8a3b8fcc1505592bbd9067beaeb6d80","ja":"「2択問題に正解し続ければ、賞金がアップ！\nただし間違えればゼロになります。今回の挑戦者は！」","zh":"“只要连续答对2选一题目，奖金就会不断增加！\n不过一旦答错就会归零。这次的挑战者是！”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1320.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"3e64e2188feb771ef0b7a8c2960a599b27314adae8e3e42b91ed77652e2a470b","ja":"ロコです！　アートに関するクイズなら\n任せてください♪","zh":"我是ROCO！要是艺术相关的测验，\n就交给我吧♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1320.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"aecc29080562869bff57f537f976a0fc78f68d702f418b76e800141dfd3dc26a","ja":"舞浜歩だよ。勉強系の問題はあんまり得意じゃない\nけど……ダンス関係の問題なら任せて！","zh":"我是舞滨步。虽然不太擅长学习类的问题，\n不过……舞蹈相关的问题就包在我身上吧！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1320.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"4c7ac6fe8b816f66e0e0ff8d45b3f6279cffe0224aa419ad58ad7ff8d613bfe8","ja":"ふたりともやる気いっぱいだね。\n私も頑張りま～す！　……あっ、北上麗花で～す♪","zh":"两个人都有干劲满满呢。\n我也要加油～！……啊，我是北上丽花～♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1320.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"5f566f07f5a3d0276703e005a7142852767c1076db22e54a6f531d47e31f459a","ja":"「途中でサレンダーせずに賞金全額を持ち帰れるで\nしょうか！？　では、最初の問題です！」","zh":"“能否在中途不认输投降，将全额奖金带回家\n呢！？　那么，请听第一题！”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1320.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"b4932363f24e9a2ef294a88631df72243f941b5a263fcbf5b993d7391018a172","ja":"収録は順調に進んで……","zh":"录制进展得很顺利……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1320.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"7e745227b8c60c07ee4e4ebcc7c74cee6f0a47270aa351187ac7426e73e9ed6f","ja":"じゃあ……Aの『夏』で！","zh":"那就……选A的“夏天”！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1320.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"e25865dd6cd9642984f2a33dc26e423786c43ef29a66b1c88228520b16914025","ja":"「冬瓜の旬はA『夏』かB『冬』か。\n正解は……Aの『夏』です！」","zh":"“冬瓜的时令是A‘夏天’还是B‘冬天’？\n正确答案是……A的‘夏天’！”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1320.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"fe24b76c9817a305e15ded87ddb954e77d8e45135f7390874c3e6420c6757d32","ja":"また当たった！　アタシは『冬』かと思ったよ……\n知ってたのか、麗花？","zh":"又答对了！我还以为是“冬”呢……\n你早就知道了吗，丽花？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1320.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"8ec912126a5e003424560153a8332e4f2498b80e9f1fb3f196d58d30a2779a86","ja":"ううん、知らなかったよ。\nでもなんとなく『夏』かな～って♪","zh":"没有，我不知道呢。\n不过总觉得很有“夏天”的感觉～♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1320.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"d2c51856b796d70e60124808f80391b70d84981bee738311cbdc872dae8f35ba","ja":"レイカの『なんとなく』で正解が続いたお陰で\nいいところまで来ましたね！","zh":"多亏丽花凭“感觉”接连答对，\n我们才走到了这么关键的一步呢！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1320.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"741f377ee96b51cdd4da19c52eb1553edbbaee289cb44623849f388f87bc8a4f","ja":"このまま賞金が増えていけば、\nロコの個展の開催も夢じゃないです！","zh":"只要奖金继续这么增加下去，\n举办ROCO的个展也不是梦想了！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1320.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"69730500141d164dbbd1d0313d538912e0566096081adc82db5e5637e8407255","ja":"それじゃあアタシは、有名ダンサーを集めて\nアタシ主催のダンスバトル大会をしちゃおうかなー♪","zh":"那我就把知名舞者召集起来，\n办一场由我主办的街舞对抗赛吧～♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1320.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"6c60988fe3c52ab5ff577491b03b17190b248a5788cbb3e4e8d036fd1f3f8aba","ja":"わぁ、どっちも楽しそう♪\nそれじゃあ、もっともっと正解しないとだね！","zh":"哇，感觉哪边都很有趣呢♪\n既然这样，那就得多多答对题目才行了呢！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
